/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]beads through bounded bulk mutations, preserves durable receipts [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and hidden-clone safety, and exits normally before Axe's 300-second[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]timeout.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]artifact_link_projection_timeout.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/artifact_link_projection_timeout.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-12y[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-12y/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Add an atomic bulk bead-projection core API[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]projection_batch_core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]projection_batch_core: add and publish a Rust/PyO3 batch mutation that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]preserves the exact single-projection receipt and convergence contract [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]while taking one bead lock, loading once, and saving once per bounded [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]batch.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Batch and bound artifact-link projection in SASE[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]deadline_aware_projection[dim] · [dim][/dim]after projection_batch_core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]deadline_aware_projection: pin the published core capability, route [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]full-truth bead projection through bounded batches, and propagate the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]chop deadline so partial progress is committed and safely retried [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]instead of being SIGKILLed.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prove convergence and scheduled-job completion[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]production_acceptance[dim] · [dim][/dim]after projection_batch_core, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]deadline_aware_projection[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]production_acceptance: exercise the production backfill path against a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scaled fixture and one controlled live run, proving the queued [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]operations converge, hidden sidecars remain clean, and the chop [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completes below its soft budget.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-12y","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-12y.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-a4b1d6f64ee190eeba81507524e2841f","started_at":"2026-09-18T13:49:59.149470+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"3e08300fecfbc35912d6220789b1554b15ec27719c93c56e6f5b18c1de49a9d9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-12y.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"9f9293056f685991191e2e724c8e3948af720ab97a65ba846090750ea300368a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-12y.land/meta.json","size_bytes":618},"prompt":{"digest":"1a5ed36d82214fb883be3e9f342aeb5364bf3d66652393cde8b31b1aba64e923","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-12y.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":200},"state":{"digest":"c43f9b46c50782407b0cbd85b755ad9cc33ffe69e9cb0316f202143a1dd32279","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.sase-12y.land/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.sase-12y.land","local_name":"sase-12y.land","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-12y","agent_clan_generation"